ce of Building, Grounds and Equipment: There were gaps in the chainlink fence on the playground that were large enough for a child to go through or get trapped in.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026328796","violation_type_title":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment (26 TAC §746.3407)","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1368013-i20260707-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1107-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1368013-i20260707","date":"2026-07-07","original_code":"746.1107(1)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-14","finding":"Additional Minimum Qualifications for Caregivers - Age Requirement: A fourteen-year-old volunteer was observed caring for children during the inspection. This was corrected during the inspection when the volunteer was removed from the classroom and the director was informed that caregivers must be at least eighteen years old.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026409126","violation_type_title":"Additional Minimum Qualifications for Caregivers - Age Requirement (26 TAC §746.1107(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1368013-i20260428","date":"2026-04-28","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905845464","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905845464","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2026-04-28","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1368013-i20260427","date":"2026-04-27","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report (self-reported)","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905940516","url":"https://data.texas.gov